00:05:00,000 --> 00:05:06,000
Dead in the Water is a thriller, tv movie film directed by Sheldon Wilson.

2
00:10:00,000 --> 00:10:06,000
The Nereus is a fifty-year-old Ice Breaker, salvaged by an
idealistic crew on a mission to catch illegal fisherman.

3
00:15:00,000 --> 00:15:06,000
On chase, the crew find themselves well off-course and bearing down on a
body mysteriously floating in the middle of the Devil’s Sea.

4
00:20:00,000 --> 00:20:06,000
Superstitious or not, the team soon discovers they’ve rescued a
deadly creature feeding on the lifeless body.

5
00:25:00,000 --> 00:25:06,000
Their new mission—kill or be killed and preferably before they hit land.

6
00:30:00,000 --> 00:30:06,000
Dana, played by Nikohl Boosheri.

