01:00:00,000 --> 01:00:06,000
Black Water is an American action thriller film directed by Pasha Patriki.

13
01:05:00,000 --> 01:05:06,000
It stars Jean-Claude Van Damme and Dolph Lundgren in their fifth collaboration,
specifically the second time they appear as on-screen allies.

14
01:10:00,000 --> 01:10:06,000
The film was released direct-to-video in the US on May 25, 2018.

15
01:15:00,000 --> 01:15:06,000
The film explores themes of ship, expedition,
stranger, pacific  ocean, wreckage.

16
01:20:00,000 --> 01:20:06,000
The tone is intense.
